# paper-trading-bot environment config
#
# This bot's default setup (scan, replay:raw, replay:memory) needs NO
# environment variables at all — market data comes from Binance's public
# klines endpoint, which requires no API key and has no order-placing
# capability. There is nothing to fill in below to run the bot as shipped.
#
# The variables below are placeholders for an OPTIONAL future paper-trading
# broker/exchange adapter. Do not set these unless you have verified,
# paper/test-mode-only credentials for that specific venue — and even then,
# never commit a real .env file (it is already in .gitignore).

# Example only — uncomment and fill in if you wire up a verified paper broker:
# BROKER_VENUE=alpaca
# BROKER_API_KEY=
# BROKER_API_SECRET=
# BROKER_PAPER_MODE=true
# LIVE_TRADING_ENABLED=false
